From 00cb9769f0981f23c1b6d40532a6fb231a210213 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:25:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] wasm: sound output (wasmsnd) through Web Audio

ALSA card with one S16_LE playback PCM; the host's AudioWorklet reads the
buffer from shared memory, advances hw_ptr and raises WASM_IRQ_SOUND at
period boundaries.  defconfig: SND, PCM OSS emulation (/dev/dsp).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/wasm/configs/wasm_defconfig |   7 ++
 arch/wasm/drivers/Kconfig        |   8 ++
 arch/wasm/drivers/Makefile       |   1 +
 arch/wasm/drivers/wasmsnd.c      | 192 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 arch/wasm/include/asm/wasm.h     |   3 +
 5 files changed, 211 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/wasm/drivers/wasmsnd.c

